纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["xumisun-q-a93a8b421cddca33e604"]},"ordering_evidence":"xumisun-q-a93a8b421cddca33e604","source_order":[38,4,0],"order":7013},{"id":"xumisun-e2-kongzhou-death","title":"孔伷卒","accounts":[{"id":"xumisun-a2-0715c8770cd97009bc08","label":"正文","text":"孔伷卒","evidence":["xumisun-q2-9c301e2ab0a8aaf1a509"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0059","role":"卒","evidence":["xumisun-q2-9c301e2ab0a8aaf1a509"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"第二轮逐项审定；仅保原文时序，不另行推年。","evidence":["xumisun-q2-9c301e2ab0a8aaf1a509"]},"ordering_evidence":"xumisun-q2-9c301e2ab0a8aaf1a509","order":7014},{"id":"xumisun-e-o011","title":"许靖惧诛奔孔伷","accounts":[{"id":"xumisun-a-ec711696d031935c5280","label":"正文","text":"许靖惧诛奔孔伷","evidence":["xumisun-q-1f510bb7dad9e6f68f03"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0059","role":"因从兄许玚与孔伷合谋而惧诛，奔孔伷","evidence":["xumisun-q-1f510bb7dad9e6f68f03"]},{"person":"wudi-p0059","role":"豫州刺史，许靖往投","evidence":["xumisun-q-1f510bb7dad9e6f68f03"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["xumisun-q-1f510bb7dad9e6f68f03"]},"ordering_evidence":"xumisun-q-1f510bb7dad9e6f68f03","source_order":[38,4,21],"order":7015}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0059","name":"孔伷","evidence":["wudi-q-o009","dongyuan-q-o010","lvzang-q-97153a77f484b72e8a96","lvzang-q-0c0e990ee4b0bea7826f","xumisun-q-eef790522c664266530f","xumisun-q-50c00fbc52e4c7ccad2a","xumisun-q-a93a8b421cddca33e604","xumisun-q-1f510bb7dad9e6f68f03","xumisun-q2-9c301e2ab0a8aaf1a509"],"facts":[{"id":"wudi-f-p023-wudi-p0059-c55038","label":"字","text":"公绪","evidence":["wudi-q-p023"]},{"id":"wudi-f-p023-wudi-p0059-3d9187","label":"籍贯","text":"陈留","evidence":["wudi-q-p023"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"公绪","evidence":["wudi-q-p023"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o009-wudi-p0059","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o009"]},{"id":"wudi-m-p023-wudi-p0059","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p023"]},{"id":"wudi-m-o010-wudi-p0059","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o010"]},{"id":"dongyuan-m-o010-wudi-p0059","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["dongyuan-q-o010"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o010a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-ce439e218b8e8adda84d","layer":"original","quote":"初，卓信任尚书周毖、城门校尉伍琼等。用其所举韩馥、刘岱、孔伷、张（资）〔咨〕、张邈等出宰州郡〖8〗；","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":50},{"id":"dongyuan-e-o036a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-5c715668eee2a0a99811","layer":"original","quote":"绍遂以勃海起兵，将以诛卓。语在《武纪》。","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20},{"id":"dongyuan-q-o010","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-ce439e218b8e8adda84d","layer":"original","quote":"初，卓信任尚书周毖、城门校尉伍琼等。用其所举韩馥、刘岱、孔伷、张（资）〔咨〕、张邈等出宰州郡〖8〗；而馥等至官，皆合兵将以讨卓。卓闻之，以为毖、琼等通情卖己，皆斩之。﹝二﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":86},{"id":"liusima-q-1dea94bc4c56b3bfe0b5","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-511f012c14f14dff5c5b","layer":"original","quote":"后数月，关东诸州郡起兵，众数十万，皆集荥阳及河内。诸将不能相一〖10〗，纵兵抄掠，民人死者且半","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":25,"end":72},{"id":"lvzang-q-0c0e990ee4b0bea7826f","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-e38569d56e09470a97bd","layer":"original","quote":"乃设坛场，方共盟誓；诸州郡更相让，莫敢当〖9〗，咸共推洪。洪乃升坛，操盘歃血而盟曰〖10〗：“汉室不幸，皇纲失统；贼臣董卓乘衅纵害，祸加至尊〖11〗，虐流百姓；大惧沦丧社稷，翦覆四海〖12〗。兖州刺史岱、豫州刺史伷、陈留太守邈、东郡太守瑁、广陵太守超等，纠合义兵，并赴国难。凡我同盟，齐心戮力，以致臣节；殒首丧元〖13〗，必无二志！有渝此盟，俾坠其命〖14〗，无克遗育〖15〗！皇天后土，祖宗明灵：实皆鉴之〖16〗！”洪辞气慷慨，涕泣横下。闻其言者，虽卒伍厮养〖17〗，莫不激扬，人思致节","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":166,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":244},{"id":"lvzang-q-97153a77f484b72e8a96","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-870f11ca48ec6ada82bc","layer":"original","quote":"致之于刘兖州公山、孔豫州公绪〖8〗，皆与洪亲善","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":165,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":79,"end":102},{"id":"rensu-q-f64cf1a8c7978e162aed","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-c172c36c6f19e1d68402","layer":"pei","quote":"关东义兵起，卓会议大发兵；群僚咸惮卓，莫敢忤旨","attribution":"裴注·张璠《汉纪》","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":338,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-011440cf6742ee5cb197","start":246,"end":269},{"id":"wudi-e-o009a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-20c7e941eb42ee97df8c","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年春正月〖1〗，后将军袁术、冀州牧韩馥、﹝一﹞豫州刺史孔伷、﹝二﹞兖州刺史刘岱、﹝三﹞河内太守王匡、﹝四﹞勃海太守袁绍、陈留太守张邈、东郡太守桥瑁、﹝五﹞山阳太守袁遗、﹝六﹞济北相鲍信，﹝七﹞同时俱起兵〖2〗。众各数万，推绍为盟主。太祖行奋武将军〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130},{"id":"wudi-e-o010b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c3c5890f31591fa3c33e","layer":"original","quote":"是时。绍屯河内〖2〗，邈、岱、瑁、遗屯酸枣〖3〗，术屯南阳〖4〗，伷屯颍川，馥在邺〖5〗。卓兵强，绍等莫敢先进。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":99,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":30,"end":86},{"id":"wudi-q-b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-4a17eb75600ced2abdde","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗初平元年：公元 190 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-93d66253e23c705b336d","start":0,"end":17},{"id":"wudi-q-o009","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-20c7e941eb42ee97df8c","layer":"original","quote":"初平元年春正月〖1〗，后将军袁术、冀州牧韩馥、﹝一﹞豫州刺史孔伷、﹝二﹞兖州刺史刘岱、﹝三﹞河内太守王匡、﹝四﹞勃海太守袁绍、陈留太守张邈、东郡太守桥瑁、﹝五﹞山阳太守袁遗、﹝六﹞济北相鲍信，﹝七﹞同时俱起兵〖2〗。众各数万，推绍为盟主。太祖行奋武将军〖3〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":84,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":130},{"id":"wudi-q-o010","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c3c5890f31591fa3c33e","layer":"original","quote":"二月，卓闻兵起，乃徙天子都长安〖1〗。卓留屯洛阳，遂焚宫室。是时。绍屯河内〖2〗，邈、岱、瑁、遗屯酸枣〖3〗，术屯南阳〖4〗，伷屯颍川，馥在邺〖5〗。卓兵强，绍等莫敢先进。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":99,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":86},{"id":"wudi-q-p023","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-17a042beefd6e104d157","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《英雄记》曰：“伷字公绪，陈留人。”张璠《汉纪》载郑泰说卓云：“孔公绪能清谈高论，嘘枯吹生。”","attribution":"《英雄记》、张璠《汉纪》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":91,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-bbbc2e82979c58ce6a4f","start":0,"end":50},{"id":"xumisun-q-1f510bb7dad9e6f68f03","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-a16f26994622830805a3","layer":"original","quote":"靖惧诛，奔伷","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":21,"end":27},{"id":"xumisun-q-50c00fbc52e4c7ccad2a","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-c3b105ae63105e37b3ab","layer":"original","quote":"馥等到官，各举兵还向京都，欲以诛卓","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":173,"end":190},{"id":"xumisun-q-a93a8b421cddca33e604","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-a16f26994622830805a3","layer":"original","quote":"靖从兄陈相玚〖20〗，又与伷合规","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16},{"id":"xumisun-q-eef790522c664266530f","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-c3b105ae63105e37b3ab","layer":"original","quote":"拜尚书韩馥为冀州牧〖13〗，侍中刘岱为兖州刺史〖14〗，颍川张咨为南阳太守〖15〗，陈留孔伷为豫州刺史〖16〗，东郡张邈为陈留太守","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":82,"end":147},{"id":"xumisun-q2-9c301e2ab0a8aaf1a509","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-a16f26994622830805a3","layer":"original","quote":"靖从兄陈相玚〖20〗，又与伷合规〖21〗；靖惧诛，奔伷。﹝一﹞伷卒，依扬州刺史陈祎。","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
